[et_pb_section fb_built="1" admin_label="RM Hosting Hero" _builder_version="4.27.4" use_custom_width="on" width_unit="off" custom_width_px="100%" custom_padding="0px||0px||false|false" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_row _builder_version="4.27.4" width="100%" max_width="100%" use_custom_gutter="on" gutter_width="1" custom_padding="0px||0px||false|false" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_column type="4_4" _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_code admin_label="RM Hosting Hero — Code" _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<!-- ============================================================
     RM HERO HOSTING — Hero de la página "Alojamiento web" (Divi 5,
     Code Module)
     Marca: Rodmedia · Reestructuración web
     Mismo sistema que los otros cuatro heros: fondo #0f0f1e, línea
     superior con brillo, partículas conectadas, dos glows difuminados,
     Playfair Display (con eje itálico real cargado desde el
     principio) + Inter, badge con punto parpadeante, degradado de
     marca a 135deg, entrada en scroll, tarjeta 3D con inclinación al
     cursor.

     Segunda vuelta: se abandonan los enlaces de afiliado (Webempresa/
     SiteGround) a favor de la oferta de hosting gestionado propia de
     Rodmedia. Copy nuevo de principio a fin salvo el H1, que se
     mantiene; el degradado pasa de "vive" a "tu negocio". Los
     proveedores se nombran solo en la línea de confianza bajo la
     franja de datos, sin enlazar a ningún sitio externo — dan
     solidez ("llevamos años trabajando con ellos") sin mandar a
     nadie fuera.

     Mockup: mismo panel de estado que en la primera vuelta, con la
     misma historia (fiabilidad del hosting), pero con el copy que
     pediste — etiqueta "Todo funcionando ✓", el dominio de ejemplo
     con una marca "Actualizado ✓" en vez de los medidores de uptime/
     carga, y el aviso "Copia de seguridad completada · Hoy · 03:00".

     Corrección: el botón decorativo que "pulsa" dentro del mockup
     (panel-btn) decía "Ver planes de hosting", igual que el CTA
     principal real justo debajo — parecía un botón duplicado/roto.
     Ahora dice "Acceder al panel", distinto al CTA (mismo criterio
     que el hero de dominio, cuyo botón de mockup dice "Registrarlo
     con Rodmedia").

     ANTES DE PUBLICAR:
     1) Si ya cargas Playfair Display / Inter desde el Theme Builder de
        Divi, borra el @import de aquí para evitar cargarlas dos veces.
     2) Cambia los href de "Ver planes de hosting" y "Reservar una
        llamada" por tus anclas o páginas reales.
     ============================================================ -->

<section class="rm-hero-hosting" aria-labelledby="rm-hero-hosting-title">

  <div class="rm-hero-hosting__bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="rm-hero-hosting__topline"></div>
    <canvas class="rm-hero-hosting__particles"></canvas>
    <div class="rm-hero-hosting__glow rm-hero-hosting__glow--blue"></div>
    <div class="rm-hero-hosting__glow rm-hero-hosting__glow--orange"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="rm-hero-hosting__container">

    <!-- ---------- Columna de texto ---------- -->
    <div class="rm-hero-hosting__content" data-animate>
      <span class="rm-hero-hosting__badge">
        <span class="rm-hero-hosting__badge-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        Hosting gestionado
      </span>

      <h1 id="rm-hero-hosting-title" class="rm-hero-hosting__title">
        La casa donde vive <em>tu negocio</em> en internet
      </h1>

      <p class="rm-hero-hosting__subtitle">
        Contratamos, configuramos y vigilamos tu hosting por ti, con copias de seguridad, certificado SSL y actualizaciones incluidas. Si algo falla, lo resolvemos nosotros.
      </p>

      <div class="rm-hero-hosting__note">
        <svg class="rm-hero-hosting__note-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/>
          <path d="M3 12h18M12 3c2.5 2.6 3.8 5.7 3.8 9s-1.3 6.4-3.8 9c-2.5-2.6-3.8-5.7-3.8-9S9.5 5.6 12 3Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/>
        </svg>
        <p>
          <strong>¿Tu web está en otro proveedor?</strong>
          La traemos a Rodmedia sin que deje de funcionar.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rm-hero-hosting__actions">
        <a href="#planes-hosting" class="rm-hero-hosting__cta rm-hero-hosting__cta--primary">
          <span>Ver planes de hosting</span>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M3.5 8h9M8.5 3.5 13 8l-4.5 4.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="#contacto" class="rm-hero-hosting__cta rm-hero-hosting__cta--secondary">
          Reservar una llamada
        </a>
      </div>

      <dl class="rm-hero-hosting__stats">
        <div class="rm-hero-hosting__stat">
          <dt>99,9%</dt>
          <dd>Uptime garantizado</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="rm-hero-hosting__stat">
          <dt>SSL</dt>
          <dd>Incluido</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="rm-hero-hosting__stat">
          <dt>Copias</dt>
          <dd>Diarias</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="rm-hero-hosting__stat">
          <dt>Migración</dt>
          <dd>Incluida</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>

      <p class="rm-hero-hosting__trust">
        Sobre servidores de SiteGround y Webempresa, con los que llevamos años trabajando.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- ---------- Mockup: estado del hosting en vivo ---------- -->
    <div class="rm-hero-hosting__visual" data-animate>
      <div class="rm-hero-hosting__card-back" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="rm-hero-hosting__card" role="img"
           aria-label="Panel de estado del hosting de clinicadentalmar.es: todo funcionando, sitio actualizado, copia de seguridad completada hoy a las 03:00.">

        <div class="rm-hero-hosting__shot">
          <span class="rm-hero-hosting__tag">
            <span class="rm-hero-hosting__tag-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            Todo funcionando
          </span>

          <div class="rm-hero-hosting__status">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/>
              <path d="M3 12h18M12 3c2.5 2.6 3.8 5.7 3.8 9s-1.3 6.4-3.8 9c-2.5-2.6-3.8-5.7-3.8-9S9.5 5.6 12 3Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/>
            </svg>
            <span class="rm-hero-hosting__status-domain">clinicadentalmar.es</span>
            <span class="rm-hero-hosting__status-badge">
              <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 12.5 9.5 18 20 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              Actualizado
            </span>
          </div>

          <ul class="rm-hero-hosting__features">
            <li><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 12.5 9.5 18 20 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Copia de seguridad diaria</li>
            <li><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 12.5 9.5 18 20 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Certificado SSL incluido</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rm-hero-hosting__panel">
          <span class="rm-hero-hosting__panel-label">Monitorización en tiempo real</span>
          <span class="rm-hero-hosting__panel-title">clinicadentalmar.es</span>

          <span class="rm-hero-hosting__panel-btn">
            <span class="rm-hero-hosting__panel-btn-texto">Acceder al panel</span>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rm-hero-hosting__notif">
        <span class="rm-hero-hosting__notif-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/>
          <path d="M8.5 12.5 11 15l4.5-5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
        <div>
          <strong>Copia de seguridad completada</strong>
          <span>Hoy &#183; 03:00</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,600;0,700;1,600;1,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

  .rm-hero-hosting {
    --rm-primary: #0f0f1e;
    --rm-blue: #3a7bd5;
    --rm-orange: #e8531a;
    --rm-light: #f8f8fb;
    --rm-text-muted: #9aa3bd;
    --rm-text-muted-2: #7d84a0;
    --rm-radius: 8px;
    --rm-radius-lg: 20px;
    --rm-transition: 0.3s ease;
    --rm-font-display: "Playfair Display", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    --rm-font-body: "Inter", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    --rm-loop: 9s;

    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--rm-primary);
    color: var(--rm-light);
    font-family: var(--rm-font-body);
    padding: 120px 20px 100px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting *,
  .rm-hero-hosting *::before,
  .rm-hero-hosting *::after {
    box-sizing: inherit;
  }

  /* ---------- Fondo: línea de firma + partículas + glows ---------- */
  .rm-hero-hosting__bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__topline {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--rm-blue), var(--rm-orange), var(--rm-blue));
    background-size: 200% 100%;
    animation: rm-hero-hosting-shimmer 6s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes rm-hero-hosting-shimmer {
    0% { background-position: 0% 0; }
    100% { background-position: 200% 0; }
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__particles {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__glow {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(100px);
    opacity: 0.28;
    animation: rm-hero-hosting-float 15s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__glow--blue {
    width: 480px;
    height: 480px;
    top: -150px;
    left: -110px;
    background: var(--rm-blue);
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__glow--orange {
    width: 420px;
    height: 420px;
    bottom: -170px;
    right: -110px;
    background: var(--rm-orange);
    animation-delay: -7s;
  }

  @keyframes rm-hero-hosting-float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
    50% { transform: translate(26px, 22px) scale(1.07); }
  }

  /* ---------- Contenedor ---------- */
  .rm-hero-hosting__container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 1140px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 64px;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__content[data-animate],
  .rm-hero-hosting__visual[data-animate] {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(24px);
    transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__content.is-visible,
  .rm-hero-hosting__visual.is-visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__visual[data-animate] {
    transition-delay: 0.15s;
  }

  /* ---------- Badge ---------- */
  .rm-hero-hosting__badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 7px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__badge-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rm-blue), var(--rm-orange));
    animation: rm-hero-hosting-blink 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes rm-hero-hosting-blink {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: 0.25; }
  }

  /* ---------- Titular ---------- */
  .rm-hero-hosting__title {
    font-family: var(--rm-font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 1.4rem + 3.4vw, 3.75rem);
    line-height: 1.14;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--rm-light);
    max-width: 17ch;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
  }

  /* inline-block con su propio line-height generoso: la caja del
     degradado no depende de qué fuente acabe cargando (real o
     cursiva fabricada por el navegador si el webfont no llega a
     tiempo), así las astas altas de la cursiva nunca se recortan */
  .rm-hero-hosting__title em {
    display: inline-block;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding: 0 0.02em;
    font-style: italic;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rm-blue), var(--rm-orange));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__subtitle {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--rm-text-muted);
    max-width: 48ch;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
  }

  /* ---------- Recuadro de garantía (ya tienes hosting) ---------- */
  .rm-hero-hosting__note {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: var(--rm-radius-lg);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    max-width: 48ch;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__note-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
    color: var(--rm-blue);
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__note p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--rm-text-muted);
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__note strong {
    color: var(--rm-light);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* ---------- CTAs ---------- */
  .rm-hero-hosting__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__cta {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--rm-font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: var(--rm-radius);
    padding: 15px 26px;
    transition: transform var(--rm-transition), box-shadow var(--rm-transition), border-color var(--rm-transition), color var(--rm-transition);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__cta--primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rm-blue), var(--rm-orange));
    color: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(58, 123, 213, 0.28);
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__cta--primary::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(160px circle at var(--rm-mx, 50%) var(--rm-my, 50%), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.32), transparent 70%);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity var(--rm-transition);
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__cta--primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 34px rgba(232, 83, 26, 0.35);
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__cta--primary:hover::before {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__cta--primary span,
  .rm-hero-hosting__cta--primary svg {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__cta--secondary {
    color: #e5e7eb;
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
    background: transparent;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__cta--secondary:hover {
    border-color: var(--rm-blue);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__cta:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--rm-blue);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  /* ---------- Franja de stats ---------- */
  .rm-hero-hosting__stats {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: 0;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: var(--rm-radius-lg);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025);
    overflow: hidden;
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__stat {
    flex: 1 1 0;
    min-width: 120px;
    padding: 18px 16px;
    text-align: center;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__stat:last-child {
    border-right: none;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__stat dt {
    font-family: var(--rm-font-display);
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 600;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rm-blue), var(--rm-orange));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    margin: 0 0 4px;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__stat dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--rm-text-muted-2);
  }

  /* ---------- Línea de confianza ---------- */
  .rm-hero-hosting__trust {
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    padding: 0 2px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--rm-text-muted-2);
  }

  /* ---------- Tarjeta mockup (3D: inclinación con el cursor) ---------- */
  .rm-hero-hosting__visual {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 420px;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-bottom: 40px;
    perspective: 1400px;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__card-back {
    position: absolute;
    top: 16px;
    right: -14px;
    bottom: 26px;
    left: 14px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: var(--rm-radius-lg);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    transform: translateZ(-70px) rotate(4deg) scale(0.96);
    opacity: 0.55;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__card {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: var(--rm-radius-lg);
    background: #14151f;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
    animation: rm-hero-hosting-idle-sway 7s ease-in-out infinite;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease-out;
    will-change: transform;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__visual.is-interactive .rm-hero-hosting__card {
    animation: none;
  }

  @keyframes rm-hero-hosting-idle-sway {
    0%, 100% { transform: rotateY(-5deg) rotateX(2.5deg); }
    50% { transform: rotateY(5deg) rotateX(-2.5deg); }
  }

  /* Imagen superior: foto de estudio clara, igual tratamiento que los
     otros heros */
  .rm-hero-hosting__shot {
    position: relative;
    padding: 58px 24px 26px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 30%, #fbfbfb, #dedee2 80%);
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__tag {
    position: absolute;
    top: 16px;
    left: 16px;
    z-index: 3;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 7px 13px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rm-blue), var(--rm-orange));
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__tag-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #ffffff;
    animation: rm-hero-hosting-blink 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__status {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e2e5ea;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(15, 15, 30, 0.08);
    color: #6b7290;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__status-domain {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    font-family: var(--rm-font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #1f2430;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__status-badge {
    flex: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 5px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(58, 123, 213, 0.1);
    color: var(--rm-blue);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__features {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__features li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #545b6e;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__features svg {
    flex: none;
    color: var(--rm-blue);
  }

  /* Panel inferior */
  .rm-hero-hosting__panel {
    position: relative;
    padding: 22px 20px 24px;
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__panel-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--rm-text-muted);
  }

  .rm-hero-hosting__panel-title {
    display: block;
    margin: 4px 0 16px;
    font-family: var(--rm-font-display);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
